			"notes": "## **Initial Release**\n\n### **Still in**\n![Development](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/82938173-087d-4aa0-b411-f1dd51a66c4f)\n\n**For Fabric 1.21.1**\n\nBugs may appear, please report them as soon as possible\n\nSome functionality is not implemented yet!\n\nFeatures:\n - Build signs with different textures\n - Select sign textures from texture folder\n - Rotate signs\n - Create a custom sign, although display in Minecraft is not implemented yet\n - Play around with the MWTA Sign Editor from the Custom Signs\n\nMore features appearing soon!\n\nPre-built mod is included!\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tobiazsh/myworld_traffic_addition/commits/mwtav_0.27.0-beta"
